The introduction film (spliced/web/intro.mp4) and the example film in starter/ show Spliced itself, rebuilt in
code, and the frames of a made-up film drawn for the example; no frame of a real film is in them. They are
included to introduce Spliced and to learn from, and are not covered by the code's licence for other uses. Their
music and sound effects were made with ElevenLabs.

The UI sounds in the film kit (spliced/kit/managed/public/audio/kit/) are original takes made for Spliced by
its publisher with ElevenLabs Sound Effects; kit.json beside them records the prompt each came from. They are
covered by the code's licence: use them in your own films.

